  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for TicTacToe Classic', 'description': 'Primary container for TicTacToe Classic implementation: A simple interactive Tic Tac Toe game where two players take turns marking spaces in a 3×3 grid. The first player to align three marks horizontally, vertically, or diagonally wins. The game highlights the winner and allows for a reset to play again.', 'framework': 'react', 'platform': 'web', 'container': '{\n  "name": "ColorCraft frontend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "Two Player Mode",\n      "description": "Allows two players to play against each other by taking turns.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Win Detection",\n      "description": "Automatically detects when a player has won or if the game is a draw.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Game Reset",\n      "description": "Provides a button to reset the board and start a new game.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Turn Indicator",\n      "description": "Displays which player\'s turn it is (X or O).",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#222831",\n    "secondary": "#393e46",\n    "accent": "#00adb5"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "The UI consists of a centered 3x3 grid representing the board. Above the grid, there is a title and a turn indicator. Below the grid, a message area displays the winner or draw status, and a reset button is provided to restart the game. The design is clean and minimalistic, with clear separation between cells and visual feedback for the current player."\n}'}",
